    {
      "id": "es-u01-l1",
      "title": "Greetings",
      "notes": "Spanish greetings change with the time of day: **buenos días** until about midday, **buenas tardes** in the afternoon and early evening, **buenas noches** once it's dark (it means both 'good evening' and 'good night'). **Hola** works any time.\nA question is written with an upside-down mark at the start too: **¿Cómo estás?** The opening mark warns you a question is coming, so you can raise your voice in time.\nTo answer: **bien** (well), **muy bien** (very well), **más o menos** (so-so) or **mal** (bad). Then bounce it back with **¿y tú?** (and you?).\nHola, ¿cómo estás? - Muy bien, gracias. ¿Y tú?",
      "items": [
        {"es": "hola", "en": "hello", "kind": "word", "accept_en": ["hi", "hey"], "note": "The h is silent: 'OH-la'."},
        {"es": "buenos días", "en": "good morning", "kind": "phrase", "accept": ["buen día"], "note": "Until about midday."},
        {"es": "buenas tardes", "en": "good afternoon", "kind": "phrase", "accept_en": ["good evening"], "note": "From midday until it gets dark."},
        {"es": "buenas noches", "en": "good evening", "kind": "phrase", "accept_en": ["good night"], "note": "Once it's dark - hello or goodbye."},
        {"es": "¿cómo estás?", "en": "how are you?", "kind": "phrase", "accept_en": ["how are you doing?", "how's it going?"]},
        {"es": "bien", "en": "well", "kind": "word", "accept_en": ["good", "fine"]},
        {"es": "muy bien", "en": "very well", "kind": "phrase", "accept_en": ["very good", "really well", "great"]},
        {"es": "más o menos", "en": "so-so", "kind": "phrase", "accept_en": ["more or less", "not bad", "OK"]},
        {"es": "mal", "en": "bad", "kind": "word", "accept_en": ["badly", "not well", "not good"]},
        {"es": "gracias", "en": "thank you", "kind": "word", "accept_en": ["thanks"]},
        {"es": "y", "en": "and", "kind": "word", "note": "Sounds like the 'ee' in 'see'."},
        {"es": "¿y tú?", "en": "and you?", "kind": "phrase", "accept_en": ["what about you?", "how about you?"]}
      ],
      "sentences": [
        {"es": "Hola, buenos días.", "en": "Hello, good morning.", "focus": "días", "accept_en": ["Hi, good morning."]},
        {"es": "¿Cómo estás?", "en": "How are you?", "focus": "estás", "accept_en": ["How are you doing?"]},
        {"es": "Bien, gracias. ¿Y tú?", "en": "Well, thanks. And you?", "focus": "gracias", "accept_en": ["Good, thanks. And you?", "Fine, thank you. And you?", "Good, thank you. What about you?"]},
        {"es": "Muy bien, gracias.", "en": "Very well, thank you.", "focus": "Muy", "accept_en": ["Very good, thanks.", "Very well, thanks."]},
        {"es": "Buenas tardes, Ana.", "en": "Good afternoon, Ana.", "focus": "tardes", "accept_en": ["Good evening, Ana."]},
        {"es": "Buenas noches, Carlos.", "en": "Good evening, Carlos.", "focus": "noches", "accept_en": ["Good night, Carlos."]},
        {"es": "Más o menos, ¿y tú?", "en": "So-so, and you?", "focus": "menos", "accept_en": ["More or less, and you?", "Not bad, and you?"]},
        {"es": "Hola, Ana. ¿Cómo estás?", "en": "Hi, Ana. How are you?", "focus": "Hola", "accept_en": ["Hello, Ana. How are you?"]},
        {"es": "Mal, gracias.", "en": "Not well, thanks.", "focus": "Mal", "accept_en": ["Bad, thanks.", "Not good, thank you."]}
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "es-u01-l2",
      "title": "Goodbyes and manners",
      "notes": "**Adiós** is a full goodbye; most people say **hasta luego** (see you later) even if they won't see you again today. **Hasta mañana** is 'see you tomorrow', and **nos vemos** is a relaxed 'see you'. In much of Latin America friends say **chao** (from Italian 'ciao').\nManners: **por favor** (please), **gracias** / **muchas gracias** (thank you very much). The reply is **de nada** (it's nothing = you're welcome).\n**Perdón** gets someone's attention or says sorry for a bump; **lo siento** (literally 'I feel it') is for real regret.",
      "items": [
        {"es": "adiós", "en": "goodbye", "kind": "word", "accept_en": ["bye"]},
        {"es": "hasta luego", "en": "see you later", "kind": "phrase", "accept_en": ["see you", "bye", "later"]},
        {"es": "hasta mañana", "en": "see you tomorrow", "kind": "phrase", "accept_en": ["until tomorrow"]},
        {"es": "nos vemos", "en": "see you", "kind": "phrase", "accept_en": ["see you later", "see ya"]},
        {"es": "chao", "en": "bye", "kind": "word", "accept": ["chau"], "accept_en": ["ciao", "see ya"], "note": "Informal. Argentina writes it 'chau'."},
        {"es": "por favor", "en": "please", "kind": "phrase"},
        {"es": "muchas gracias", "en": "thank you very much", "kind": "phrase", "accept_en": ["thanks a lot", "many thanks", "thank you so much"]},
        {"es": "de nada", "en": "you're welcome", "kind": "phrase", "accept_en": ["no problem", "not at all", "don't mention it", "it's nothing"]},
        {"es": "perdón", "en": "excuse me", "kind": "word", "accept_en": ["sorry", "pardon", "pardon me"]},
        {"es": "lo siento", "en": "I'm sorry", "kind": "phrase", "accept_en": ["sorry", "I am sorry"]},
        {"es": "sí", "en": "yes", "kind": "word", "note": "With an accent: 'si' without one means 'if'."},
        {"es": "no", "en": "no", "kind": "word", "accept_en": ["not"]}
      ],
      "sentences": [
        {"es": "Adiós, Ana. Hasta mañana.", "en": "Goodbye, Ana. See you tomorrow.", "focus": "mañana", "accept_en": ["Bye, Ana. See you tomorrow."]},
        {"es": "Hasta luego, Carlos.", "en": "See you later, Carlos.", "focus": "luego", "accept_en": ["See you, Carlos.", "Bye, Carlos."]},
        {"es": "Muchas gracias, Ana.", "en": "Thank you very much, Ana.", "focus": "Muchas", "accept_en": ["Thanks a lot, Ana.", "Many thanks, Ana."]},
        {"es": "De nada, Carlos.", "en": "You're welcome, Carlos.", "focus": "nada", "accept_en": ["No problem, Carlos."]},
        {"es": "Sí, por favor.", "en": "Yes, please.", "focus": "favor"},
        {"es": "No, gracias.", "en": "No, thank you.", "focus": "No", "accept_en": ["No, thanks."]},
        {"es": "Perdón, Ana.", "en": "Excuse me, Ana.", "focus": "Perdón", "accept_en": ["Sorry, Ana.", "Pardon me, Ana."]},
        {"es": "Lo siento, Carlos.", "en": "I'm sorry, Carlos.", "focus": "siento", "accept_en": ["Sorry, Carlos."]},
        {"es": "Chao, nos vemos.", "en": "Bye, see you.", "focus": "vemos", "accept_en": ["Bye, see you later.", "Ciao, see you."]},
        {"es": "Bien, gracias. Hasta luego.", "en": "Fine, thanks. See you later.", "focus": "Hasta", "accept_en": ["Good, thanks. See you later.", "Well, thank you. See you."]}
      ]
